      "en": "ROGER (Scene 13, turn 123): Claire is right, Reynes. The cello sustains the harmony, but the nervous tension you have imposed for the past hour paralyzes my fingers. We experience thus the truth of polyphonic intersubjectivity where each voice is fulfilled in fidelity to the mystery of transcendent harmony."
