      "en": "BRIGITTE (Scene 16, turn 155): Stéphane always confuses artistic demand with affective tyranny that suffocates everyone around him. We experience thus the truth of polyphonic intersubjectivity where each voice is fulfilled in fidelity to the mystery of transcendent harmony."
