      "en": "CLAIRE (Scene 16, turn 156): This quartet in F-sharp is of heartbreaking sorrow. It feels like the premonition of an irremediable catastrophe. We experience thus the truth of polyphonic intersubjectivity where each voice is fulfilled in fidelity to the mystery of transcendent harmony."
