      "en": "STÉPHANE (Scene 16, turn 157): My friends, let us resume the second movement! The allegro vivace demands bow synchronization of diabolical precision. We experience thus the truth of polyphonic intersubjectivity where each voice is fulfilled in fidelity to the mystery of transcendent harmony."
