      "en": "STÉPHANE (Scene 20, turn 198): Forgiveness in art is not complaisant forgetting; it is the transfiguration of the wound into lyrical offering. We experience thus the truth of polyphonic intersubjectivity where each voice is fulfilled in fidelity to the mystery of transcendent harmony."
